{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24450","headline":"初冬即事呈梦得 · 白居易","name":"初冬即事呈梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青毡帐暖喜微雪，红地炉深宜早寒。\n走笔小诗能和否，泼醅新酒试尝看。\n僧来乞食因留宿，客到开尊便共欢。\n临老交亲零落尽，希君恕我取人宽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}